# Deployed Google Apps Script Web App URL (ends with /exec).
# Create it from your Google Sheet: Extensions > Apps Script > deploy as Web App
# (Execute as: Me, Who has access: Anyone), then paste the URL here.
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development and set the same value in
# Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables (Production + Preview + Development).
VITE_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=
